@startuml
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei

title UR5 执行与 URP 导出一致性

component "trajectory.json\nTrajectory" as traj
component "config.execution\nURScript默认参数" as execconf
component "URScriptExecutionProfile" as profile
component "URScriptBuilder\ncompile_urscript()" as builder
component "URP Exporter\nexport_trajectory_urscript()" as urpexporter
component "example.urp 模板" as template
component "机械臂页直接执行\nrobot_page" as robotpage
component "数字文件页导出\nexport_page" as exportpage
node "UR5控制器" as ur5 {
  component "Script Socket 30002" as socket
  component "Dashboard 29999" as dashboard
}
file "*.urp" as urp
file "*.script / cachedContents" as cached

execconf --> profile : output delay / blend / speed / acceleration
traj --> builder
profile --> builder

robotpage --> profile
robotpage --> traj
robotpage --> dashboard : check_motion_ready()
robotpage --> builder : compile_urscript()
builder --> socket : 直接发送URScript

exportpage --> profile
exportpage --> traj
exportpage --> urpexporter
urpexporter --> builder : 同一入口生成脚本
urpexporter --> template
urpexporter --> urp
urp --> cached : cachedContents = script

note right of builder
生成脚本包含:
1. set_digital_out(DO0, False)
2. movej(准备姿态)
3. movel轨迹点(DO/速度/blend)
4. movej(准备姿态)
end note

note bottom of profile
这些是UR5/URScript后端参数
保存在 config.execution
不进入通用 trajectory.json
end note

@enduml
